  "abstract": "Factorized loadings L=U@V^T with reduced projection rank p=24 (vs 32) to test efficiency and potential regularization benefits. Uses oscillatory 2nd-order SSM factors, input-adaptive temporal gating, global horizon gating, residual copy head, and MAE+curvature loss.",
